    "text": "actionnewsnow.com\nwebsite\nChico\nHearing on the City of Chico's motions on issues regarding the Warren v. City of Chico homeless settlement agreement set for October\n54 minutes ago\nThe City of Chico filed its first motion seeking relief from the Warren v. City of Chico Homeless Settlement agreement in early August and agreed to wait to file the second motion to secure an October hearing date with Legal Services of Northern California, who represents the plaintiffs in the settlement agreement.",
